 Is Z_7*-averaging a VALID lower bound on the raw floor gap?  (klein-S9)
======================================================================================
 checked 127 nonempty cores O subset Z_7.
 averaging VALID (avg_gap <= raw_gap) for 97/127;  FAILS for 30.

